Added `get_provider_record` and `provider_record_names` to the control panel module, the counterparts of `plone.api.portal.get_registry_record` for this package's layout: a caller names the provider and the field — `driver`, `enabled`, `config.client_id` — instead of assembling a dotted record name or walking `registry.records` itself. Nothing outside the storage module needs to know that providers live under a prefix any more. @ericof
